#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:5
#: 1a0a3c781fd34dad8fa8375ff277a4af
msgid "Live Video"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:7
#: b2d8d6175b2741feb5d438877300cbab
msgid "This page explains how live video can be displayed on Mission Planner's Data screen"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:10
#: 6408cc588e694d968789bd20b9059bbf
msgid "HUD"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:16
#: a1443a613a6d4e6ab4f962ac1833455b
msgid "To display video from a :ref:`Herelink <common-herelink>` on the HUD please follow the `CubePilot instructions <https://docs.cubepilot.org/user-guides/herelink/herelink-user-guides/share-video-stream>`__ which include:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:18
#: 37a119fb751a49d0bdb9698f20ba7c5b
msgid "Ensure the camera gimbal is connected to the Herelink AirUnit's HDMI port (see RTSP video instructions below if using ethernet)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:19
#: dd3e84143b7245969591d0e69911bfc7
msgid "Ensure the PC is connected to the Herelink GroundUnit's Wifi AP"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:20
#: 31e7b6fe57f34d358276c28641fc3f86
msgid "Right-mouse-button click on Mission Planner's Data screen's HUD and select Video, Herelink"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:21
#: bbedc1c7cc0b4d04bbf02c9705f72533
msgid "Enter the Herelink GroundUnit's IP address which is normally 192.168.43.1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:23
#: 1d7e9afb6daa418b817e6a291001bad0
msgid "For non-Herelink setups, an RSTP video stream can be displayed on the HUD by doing the following:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:25
#: f70cfd7f5d4d48cd8e18907941ab9ad1
msgid "Right-mouse-button click on the HUD and select Video, Set GStreamer Source"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:26
#: c0874ab9bea844a2a8926a5e9b95e97e
msgid "Input the GStream pipeline.  The pipeline below is known to work for the :ref:`Siyi A8 <common-siyi-zr10-gimbal>` using IP address of '192.168.144.25:8554'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:28
#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:52
#: 0a86229fa6c742ecb58f86bc4dfac469
#: 7c3508822c9e4c5784b93e43ae34aede
msgid "``rtspsrc location=rtsp://192.168.144.25:8554/main.264 latency=41 udp-reconnect=1 timeout=0 do-retransmission=false ! application/x-rtp ! decodebin3 ! queue max-size-buffers=1 leaky=2 ! videoconvert ! video/x-raw,format=BGRA ! appsink name=outsink sync=false``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:31
#: b723e1d33ca64b00a22e6b622268152c
msgid "Pop-Out or within Map"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:37
#: e63a3edbe5d7448a9bc886f633d2e442
msgid "To display video in a pop-out window or within the Data screen's map area:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:39
#: 142b117dc4d54ffc9b0b4056c6283758
msgid "Right-mouse-button click on the Data screen's map area and select Gimbal Video, and then \"Full Sized\", \"Mini\" or \"Pop Out\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:40
#: 5aa16c12df764ee1945b209cdba756d7
msgid "An new window or portion of the map view should display \"No Video\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:41
#: a0473d258e3b4342b8098e26b39b0db6
msgid "Right-mouse-button click on \"No Video\" to display the menu and select \"Video Stream\" to display the \"VideoStreamSelector\" window"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:47
#: 3731fedadb024ca4b087facabbdb230e
msgid "The \"Detected Streams\" drop-down will be populated if the autopilot or camera gimbal is publishing the `VIDEO_STREAM_INFORMATION <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#VIDEO_STREAM_INFORMATION>`__ mavlink message"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:49
#: 70ca633b1267407e84ce82e5a37de0ce
msgid "Please install the `video-stream-information.lua <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/refs/heads/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/video-stream-information.lua>`__ script on the autopilot and set the VID1_CAMMODEL parameter to the camera being used"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:50
#: f65de083400e43969fce5e94f325cec5
msgid "Alternatively if the above script cannot be used, fill in the GStreamer pipeline directly.  The pipeline below is known to work for the :ref:`Siyi A8 <common-siyi-zr10-gimbal>` using IP address of '192.168.144.25:8554'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:54
#: 0766a4da537441fc8a077789d0c12989
msgid "The gimbal movements can be controlled directly from the live video screen by left-mouse-button clicking on the video or via keyboard shortcuts. These shortcuts can be viewed and changed by right-mouse-button clicking on the video area and selecting Settings"
msgstr ""
